      "lines": [
        "注　用数学归纳法可以证明，这个定理对任意有限个函数的和也",
        "正确：",
        "$(u_1+u_2+\\cdots+u_n)'=u_1'+u_2'+\\cdots+u_n'.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习　题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用第 43 小节中的例子和第 352 和 354 题，求下列各",
        "函数的导数："
      ],
      "owner_exercises": [
        "363",
        "364",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "363",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $f(x)=x+5$；　　б) $g(x)=x^2+3.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "364",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $h(x)=x^2+x$；　　б) $u(x)=x^2+x+7.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "365",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "а) $v(x)=x^2+\\frac{1}{x}+5$；　　б) $y(x)=x^2+\\frac{1}{x}+\\sqrt{x}.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "366",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明：如果两个函数都有导数，那么它们的差的导数等",
        "于它们的导数的差。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "45. 函数的积的导数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "引理．如果函数 $f$ 在点 $x_0$ 有导数，那么",
        "$\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\Delta f(x_0)=0.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\Delta f(x_0)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta f(x_0)}{\\Delta x}\\cdot\\Delta x=f'(x_0)\\cdot0=0.$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由这个引理得出，函数 $f$ 在点 $x_0$ 有导数，那么函数 $f$ 在该点连续。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "事实上，因为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$f(x)=f(x_0)+f(x)↵-f(x_0)=f(x_0)+\\Delta f(x_0),$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以只要回忆一下第 42 小节中对公式（3）所作的说明就可",
        "得出："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\lim_{x\\to x_0}f(x)=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}(f(x_0)+\\Delta f(x_0))↵=f(x_0)+\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\Delta f(x_0)=f(x_0).$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
